  "question": {
    "text": "A line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and perpendicular to the line <math><msub><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is also intersecting the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If line <math><mi>L</mi></math> intersects the plane <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><mn>2020</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
